p.src:
Write the expectation value in full: $\begin{aligned}
\expect{M_A}
&=\bra{\Psi}M_A\otimes I_B\ket{\Psi} \\
&=\sum_{a',b'}\sum_{a,b}
\psi^*(a',b')\psi(a,b)
\bra{a'}M_A\ket{a}\delta_{b'b} \\
&=\sum_{a',a,b}
\psi^*(a',b)\psi(a,b)
\bra{a'}M_A\ket{a}.\end{aligned}$

